      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cacto. Cacnea prefere ambientes hostis, como desertos. Ele consegue sobreviver por 30 dias usando a água armazenada no próprio corpo. Vive em regiões áridas, e suas flores amarelas desabrocham uma vez por ano.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Cacnea pode evoluir para Cacturne no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Poison Sting</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Absorb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Bullet Seed, Needle Arm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Feint Attack, Power Trip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Ingrain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Spikes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Pin Missile</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Energy Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Cotton Spore, Sandstorm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Destiny Bond</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Block, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulldoze, Bullet Seed, Confide, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Drain Punch, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Leaf Storm, Low Kick, Magical Leaf, Nasty Plot, Nature Power, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Role Play, Round, Sandstorm, Scary Face, Seed Bomb, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Spikes, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Throat Chop, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Toxic Spikes, Trailblaze, Venoshock, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acid, Belch, Block, Counter, Disable, Dynamic Punch, Fell Stinger, Grass Whistle, Low Kick, Magical Leaf, Nasty Plot, Power-Up Punch, Rototiller, Seed Bomb, Smelling Salts, Switcheroo, Teeter Dance, Worry Seed</p>",
